# Enhance UI/UX with Animations

This plan outlines the steps to beautify the FakeCheckPro frontend by adding smooth, modern animations and premium micro-interactions. All changes will preserve existing layouts, structure, and backend integrations.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I plan to install **Framer Motion** (`npm install framer-motion`), an industry-standard animation library for React. It allows us to add beautiful spring-physics animations and staggered entrances effortlessly. Please let me know if you approve this addition to the `package.json`.

## Proposed Changes

We will systematically enhance the frontend components with entry animations, hover effects, and premium transitions.

### 1. Project Dependencies

- Install `framer-motion` in the frontend directory.

### 2. Global Styles (`src/index.css`)

